# Route: guide 40 of 50 of the simulator's completionist route for Human (1452
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.9 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 56 to 58, 66
# quests, 3.2 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Ironforge, Eastern Plaguelands, Darnassus, Felwood, Redridge
# Mountains, Stormwind City, Dun Morogh, Alterac Mountains, Blasted Lands):
# Ironforge -> near Ironforge -> Ironforge -> Light's Hope Chapel ->
# Quel'Lithien Lodge -> Lake Mereldar -> The Undercroft -> near Craftsmen's
# Terrace -> Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's
# Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace -> Felpaw Village -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Rise, Obsidion! (3566; Lathoric
# the Black 52, Obsidion 52); Gnogaine (2926; Irradiated Invader 24-26,
# Irradiated Pillager 25-26); Save Techbot's Brain! (2922; Techbot 26);
# Crushridge Warmongers (504; Crushridge Warmonger 39-40).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Knowledge in the Deeps (971), Knowledge in the Deeps
# (971), Mythology of the Titans (1050), Mythology of the Titans (1050), The
# Lost Tablets of Will (1139), Back to Uldaman (2200), Restoring the Necklace
# (2204), The Lost Dwarves (2398), Essential Artificials (2924), Essential
# Artificials (2924), The Grand Betrayal (2929), The Grand Betrayal (2929),
# Data Rescue (2930), Data Rescue (2930), Kharan Mighthammer (4341), The Fate
# of the Kingdom (4362), The Restless Dead (96394), The Restless Dead (96394),
# An Ancient Grudge (96395), Important Heirlooms (96403), Important Heirlooms
# (96403), The Treaty of Understanding (98423), Dawn's Gambit (4771), The
# Flesh Does Not Lie (5212), The Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi
# (5214), Houses of the Holy (5243), The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond
